          "text": "CHU Chien 朱珔 (T. 玉存, 蘭坡), Nov., 1769–1850, May 24, official and scholar, was a native of Ching-hsien, Anhwei. His ancestors are said to have migrated from Soochow to Wu-yüan, Anhwei, at the close of the T'ang period, and later to Ching-hsien.",
